# The reference page is generated, not committed -- it is ~4k lines of mostly
# inlined JSON, which swamps a review diff every time the keymap changes.
# Build it with `node site/build.mjs` after cloning, or after editing keymap.c.
#
# QMK's root .gitignore already ignores `index.html` for the doxygen output,
# but this states the intent locally rather than depending on that rule.
index.html
